# Alpha-masked sample (v3.0 Phase 4): a fence plane whose base
# texture (assets/fence-alpha.png, generated by
# tools/make_example_textures.f90) has hard alpha -- slats are
# opaque, the gaps between them are alpha 0.  With `alpha mask`
# the v3 renderer discards the gap fragments and re-shades what
# is behind them, so the backdrop cube shows through the fence.
scene "alpha-masked" size 640 480 background black
camera at 0 1 9 look 0 0 0 fov 60
light directional dir -0.5 -1 -0.7 strength 1.2
cube backdrop blue at 0 0 -3 size 5
plane fence white at 0 0 0 size 7 texture "assets/fence-alpha.png" alpha mask cutoff 0.5
render
